# Leaks accepted for now (see the TODO). One entry per leak, with a reason.

# Fontconfig builds its configuration on the first use and keeps it until the
# process ends (Xft never calls FcFini). It is not ours to free.
leak:libfontconfig.so

# The test client of tests/client.h whose connection was killed on purpose
# (close_kills_a_client_without_delete_protocol) cannot be closed cleanly.
leak:Client::Client
